* * * * * * * * * * * * * *
The Story of RESCUE ROVER 2
* * * * * * * * * * * * * *

You are Roger, and your faithful dog Rover has once again been dognapped by the evil Robots!

They're back, and they mean business!


Luckily, you're much smarter than they are.

Walk through new traps and evade brand new robots in these all-new, challenging Robot Rooms!


